MA
collecting collector collect~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+G'We use it all at the workshop! Bring me:

any random object, like a &+Wm&+Ya&+Wg&+Yi&+Wc&+Ya&+Wl &+rruby &+Ltunic&N
any salvaged component, like &+csome te&Nm&+cpe&Nr&+ced iron&N
any strange stone, like a &+Lstrange &+Wsharp &+rrubin&N
any recipe, like &+ya ti&+Yght&+yly &+Lrolled &+yvellum &+Yrecipe &+yfor &+Lan &+Mobs&+mid&+Mian &+Lring&N

