favor~
&N$n nods at $N and says &+G'One of my tinkerer cousins here is a big fan of Barlow's brew.  Well, he overheard some of those brewers say they were looking to..' he gulps and continues &+W'Try to my tinkerers!'
&NHe scoffs and continues &+G'Well, we'll have to get them before they get us, eh $N?'
&+G'Return to me with five of their &+ybadges&+G, and I'll know the deed is done'&n, $n whispers with &+rbloodlust&N in his eyes.

&n$n says &+G'Another thing, $N..those &+Rmedals of honor&+G?  I'll pay ye for four of em!'
~
