~
MA
medal medals honor~
&N$n grins at $N and says &+G'Medals of Honor are rewarded all over Alatorin for certain deeds that honor the king.  Tell ya what, $N, if you bring me &+Rfour&+W of those &+Cmedals of honor&+W, I will repay you with a special &+Rtoken &+Wof &+Rgnome currency&+W!'
~
