a&+Gnd &+W50 platinum&+G for my troubles.

&+G'There are five different pieces of &+mte&+Mmpere&+d &+Cmithril &n&+marm&+Mor &+Gand thus five different pieces of &+Bbody enhancements&+G that I can craft for you, $N!' he says.
