MA
tithes tithe~
&N$n smiles, perhaps for the first time this conversation.
&+Y'Glad to hear yar ready to join, $N!' &Nhe says.
&+Y'Entry fees to King Taark's Legionnaires is two thousand coins of platinum,
&+Y'and of course we would also take a gnomish shopkeeper token.' &Nhe says with a grin.
&N$n leans back on his large broadsword and says &+Y'We could use ye, $N!'
&+Y'After all, everyone in King Taark's Legion pays tithes.' he grunts matter-of-factly.
~
