hi hello~
&N$n says &+Y"Gimbrin's the name. Smithin's the game. I work with metal
&+Ymaterials, ye know, from salvaging armor? Here's what I can do:

&+YGive me six pieces of the same top tier metal materials, &+mso&+Mme &+mte&+Mmp&+mer&+Med&N
&+mmit&+Mhri&+ml ar&+mmo&+Mr&+Y, so I know what I'm workin with, and &Nfifty &+Wplatinum coins
&+Yfor me efforts, and I'll smith ye somethin' boundta' knot their beards!'
&+Y'If it's a premium metal,' &N$n &Nadds &+Y'Add a &+Rgn&+romi&+Rsh &+Lshopkeepers token&+Y.'

&+ciron&N: &+ca rare piece of &+Bcold-&+Ciron&N
steel: &Na rare piece of &+bcold&+csteel&N
&+ybrass&N: &+ya rare piece of magical brass&N
&+ybronze: &Na rare piece of &+yb&nl&+ye&ns&+ys&Ne&+yd bronze&N
&+yc&No&+ypp&Ne&+yr&N: &+ya rare piece of enchanted c&No&+yp&Np&+ye&Nr&N
&+csilver&N: &+Ca rare piece of magical silver&N
&+Y*&Welectrum&N: &+Wa rare piece of glowing electrum&N (&+Y* &N+&+Rgn&+romi&+Rsh &+Lshopkeepers token&N)
&+Y*&+Ygold&N: &+Ya rare piece of g&+Wl&+Yi&+Wt&+Yt&+We&+Yr&+Wi&+Yn&+Wg &+Ygold&N (&+Y* &N+&+Rgn&+romi&+Rsh &+Lshopkeepers token&N)
&+Y*&+Wplatinum&N: &+Wa rare piece of glowing platinum&N (&+Y* &N+&+Rgn&+romi&+Rsh &+Lshopkeepers token&N)
&+Y*&+mm&+Mi&+mt&+Mh&+mr&+Mi&+ml&N: &+Can ancient chunk of dwarven mithril&N (&+Y* &N+&+Rgn&+romi&+Rsh &+Lshopkeepers token&N)
&+Y*&+La&+md&+La&+mm&+La&+mn&+Lt&+mi&+Lu&+mm&N: &+Lsome ancient &+ma&+Ld&+ma&+Lm&+ma&+Ln&+mn&+Lt&+mi&+Lu&+mm&N (&+Y* &N+&+Rgn&+romi&+Rsh &+Lshopkeepers token&N)

&+YFor example: give me six &+crare pieces of &+Bcold-&+Ciron&+Y, &+mso&+Mme te&+mmpe&+Mred&+m mit&+Mhr&+mil
&+Mar&+mmpla&+Mtes&+Y from Steelgrip's Depot, and &Nfifty &+Wplatinum coins&+Y, and I'll smith
