hi hello~
&N$n says 'Hello $N,' sniffling.
&NHe continues 'We used to have so many from Hammerhelm here.  Sometimes the entire Hammer and Shield would be full of cadets after they would return from their training!  Now, not so much $N..'
With a sigh, he continues 'Now Hammerhelm is different.'
~
MA
hammerhelm different~
&N$n nods at $N and says 'Hammerhelm used to be a fun place for the cadets, but now they are locked in - and they don't even want to leave!  You know why?  It's that swamp troll!'
$n spits on the ground.
'Ever since they captured that damned monster,' he adds, 'the Hammerhelm Dojo has been the hotspot for almost all of their troops, and a whole lot of our business!'
~
MA
swamp troll~
&N$n says 'Precisely, $N!  The swamp troll shackled up in Hammerhelm!  Once we, purify the Dojo, so to speak, I can start playing for an audience and my baritone-blowin' cousin won't have to pick up the slack!'
'Bring me the gored tongue of the swamp troll, so that I know it is dead and fresh, and I will reward you.'
~
QA
&N$n says 'Excellent, you did it!  The Hammerhelm crowd will once again enter the walls of the Hammer and Shield, where their fathers spent their time and so did their fathers!  It is a dwarven traditoin, here in Alatorin!'
$n flashes a wicked grin and turns to $N.
~
