MA
sword swords blade blades~
&N$n says 'Your weapons truly are of great interest to me, and, perhaps, the ones you can 'gather' for me.'
With a sigh, $n says 'You see $N, I am seeking to remove all weapons from this world so all dwarves can live in peace and harmony with each other.  Our people must control their blood, for our warriors have all but vanished as a result!  There is no more a need for us to bare arms.;
&N$n continues 'There are a few particular weapons. I will give you a list of them..'
&+WWinterhaven longswords, wielded by those fancy-looking watchman on the roads of Winterhaven.  Winterhaven should be the first to lower their swords.
&+LOrcish-forged swords from those fowl Orcs of Shady Grove.  We have encountered spiritual orcs and believe that to turn the brutes, we must start with their brutish weapons.
&+LOne of a member's official daggers of the crime group, the &N&+cVistani&+L.
&+gThe straight-bladed swords of &+Gj&N&+ga&+Gd&N&+ge, wielded by the highlanders outside the Jade city.
&+YSerrated &n&+ystone daggers, notoriously wielded by the caverns of the bandit camp of Evermeet, located on the tip of Neverwind Mountains.
&+LBlack &N&+csteel &+Ldaggers, or blackened &n&+csteel&+L longswords from the rogues of Ceothia.
&+LAnd finally, the adamantite weapons the githzerai are popularizing in this world again.  A.. well.. 'visit' to their Venan'Trut outpost revealed an array of adamantite weapons.
&N'Return to me with any of these weapons and I will pay you for your assistance, $N' $n says, nodding his head.
~
